{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/label_33.json","id":33608,"nhanesId":"","bundleName":"","fullName":"Amplified Creatine XXX Ripped Fruit Punch","brandName":"GNC Pro Performance AMP","brandIpSymbol":"®","upcSku":"0 48107 13626 0","productVersionCode":"CODE 370086 GOG","pdf":"","thumbnail":"","servingsPerContainer":"20","hasOuterCarton":false,"percentDvFootnote":"Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet.","labelRelationships":[{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":49626}],"contacts":[{"contactId":2550,"text":"Distributed by","types":["Distributor"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_1.json","id":2550,"name":"General Nutrition Corporation","streetAddress":"","city":"Pittsburgh","state":"PA","country":"","zipCode":"15222","phoneNumber":"","email":"","webAddress":""}},{"contactId":3984,"text":"For More Information","types":["Other"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_1.json","id":3984,"name":"","streetAddress":"","city":"","state":"","country":"","zipCode":"","phoneNumber":"1-888-462-2548","email":"","webAddress":""}}],"netContents":[{"order":1,"quantity":13.73,"unit":"Oz(s)","display":"13.73 Oz(s)"},{"order":2,"quantity":389.2,"unit":"Gram(s)","display":"389.2 Gram(s)"}],"physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":9.73,"maxQuantity":19.46,"minDailyServings":1,"maxDailyServings":1,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"1-2 scoops","inSFB":true}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"statements":[{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"{images}\nDaily\nPre/Post-Workout\nStrength\nThermogenic"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"The Evolution of Performance Supplementation"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"GNC's most advanced creatine formula, Amplified Creatine XXX(TM), has evolved even further with the launch of Amplified Creatine XX(TM) Ripped, the line's first and only creatine formulated to help meet your specific training goals, build lean muscle, increase strength and fuel a ripped physique.* This unique formula features an unstoppable blend of 4 key forms of creatine designed to provide an instant release of creatine and using the GNC exclusive Optimal Timing Technology (OT2(TM)), a form that releases over 6 hours for optimal creatine absorption."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"To help provide that chiseled look, this formula also supplies a water balance blend to help regulate fluid balance.*\nAdvanced Multi-Phase Creatine Complex\nThis breakthrough formula was created with the ultimate goal of fueling ripped and powerful muscles by combining powerful doses of clinically proven ingredients to provide the strength benefits of an advanced creatine blend with extra support to regulate water balance.*"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Loaded with 4 unique creatine sources, including OT2(TM) creatine, creatine HCL, creatine ethyl ester and creatine citrate, this powerful formula helps increase strength and build lean muscle.* The OT2(TM) allows for a 6-hour extended release of creatine to feed your muscles before, during and after your toughest workouts to maximize your results.*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Ripped Creatine Precursor Blend\nPacked with 1g opuntia and key metro precursors. Opuntia is a clinically studied ingredient to modulate insulin to help optimize your results by supporting enhanced nutrient uptake and shuttling nutrients into your muscles where you need it most.* \nRipped Blend\nLoaded with CIA, green coffee extract, lychee fruit and dandelion root, this advanced formula overcomes one of the biggest challenges with a creatine supplement — maintaining a ripped and shredded physique. Anchored with a 3.4g dose of CLA, this blend combines clinically proven results to improve overall body composition, fuel energy and ignite fat metabolism.* The non-stim green coffee extract provides powerful antioxidant benefits and supports glucose metabolism.*"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Who can benefit from taking Amplified Creatine XXX(TM) Ripped? \nAmplified Creatine XXX(TM) Ripped has re-engineered the use for creatine supplements. If your goal is to increase strength and power without sacrificing the ripped physique you've worked for, this formula is for you."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"You can customize your dosing and supplementation regimen to meet your specific training goals and nutrition needs."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NEW"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"4 PRODUCTS IN ONE"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"- Build Strength & Get Shredded with 5g Multi-Phase Creatine Complex to Build Lean Muscle^*\n- Powerful Metablolic Fuel with 3.4g CLA & 200mg Green Coffee\n- Enhanced with Herbal Compounds to Help Regulate Water Balance as You Strive for a Ripped Physique*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"CLINICALLY RESEARCHED"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NATURAL + ARTIFICIAL FLAVORS"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"BANNED SUBSTANCE FREE+ {checkmark}"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"OT2 OPTIMAL TIMING TECHNOLOGY"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"DIETARY SUPPLEMENT"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"AMP\n"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 370086 GOG"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: As a dietary supplement, mix 1 scoop (9.73 g) with 4-5 fl.oz. of water or your favorite beverage, pre, during or post-workout. For maximum results, mix 2 scoops (19.46 g) with 8-10 fl.oz. of water or favorite beverage pre-workout and sip thoughout your workout to power your training."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"WARNING: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, under 18 years of age or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"WARNING: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, under 18 years of age or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NOTICE: Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Clarinol(R) CLA is a registered trademark of Stepan Specialty Products LLC."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"^When used in conjunction with resistance training."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Per 2 scoop serving."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Amplified Creatine XXX(TM) Ripped Features 4 Products in 1!\n1. Creatine\n2. Opuntia (Prickly Pear)\n3. Dandelion Root\n4. Green Coffee Bean"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"INFORMED-CHOICE {CHECKMARK}.ORG\nTrusted by sport"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"CONTAINS: Milk and Soybeans."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"CONTAINS: Milk and Soybeans."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Products bearing this logo have been tested for banned substances by HFL Sport Science, a world-class anti-doping lab. \n+Product was tested for over 145 banned substances on the 2013 World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA) Prohibited List via HFL skip lot testing protocol #ICP0307. See gnc.com for more information."},{"type":"Precaution